    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "2-B"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Letting this?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This site"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We'll be filtering and grilling fish."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "UM..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Our next class will be cooking practice."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The fish will be prepared here, so make sure to bring your aprons."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It is"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "#85 (10)000 Family...every."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Cooking practice..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Home Economics"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": ">il"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I hope I do well."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well, you should be fine, president."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You're good at cooking, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Filleting fish should be nothing..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "GHA- AAA!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Gaaaaay. Hhhh!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Stiles"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "WHAT'S WRONG,  PREST-  DENT!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "WHY ARE YOU HYEKVENTI- LATING!!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I can't..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Miyuki Shirogane Wants to Prepare"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Chapter 49"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "An"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I know I'm good at cooking..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But not this!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Anything but fish!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How much!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Cooking practice!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "While Shuchi'in Academy placed a heavy emphasis on academics, it offered lessons in home economics as well!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "In order to teach students who lived on takeout"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The basics of cooking and nutrition,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "THE HOME ECONOMICS PROFESSORS HAD THE AUTHORITY TO HAVE THEM PRACTICE PREPARING FOOD IN CLASS!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I mean, I LOVE SUSH,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "AND I LIKE GRILLED FISH,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Cooking practice fish fillet"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But we're filling them..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "AND YOU NEED RAW FISH TO DO THAT."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Which means you have to touch the fish!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Shirogane"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Was the kind of man who could not touch fish!!"
    }
